    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d634">

                <pb facs="0888" n="876" sameAs="frus:frus1945v06/pg876"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 FEAC/12–245: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Harriman</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-12-02T20:00:00+03:00">December 2, 1945—8
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received December 2—1:30 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>4029. ReDeptel 2432, Dec 1, 6 p.m. Have studied contents of Dept’s Nos. 2433 and
                    2434, Dec 1, 6 p.m. and find that amendments from original draft incorporate
                    amendments which I have already submitted to Molotov under instructions or
                    incorporate certain of his <pb facs="0889" n="877" xml:id="pg877"/> suggested
                    amendments except for one minor change in language. I therefore have no comment
                    to make at this time.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Harriman</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
